Package: plotphotos
Type: Package
Title: Organize Field Photographs and Annotate Capture Dates
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Josef", "Brůna", email = "josef.bruna@ibot.cas.cz",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Institute of Botany", role = "cph")
    )
Description: Organizes field photographs and accompanying files using plot
    coordinates, filename prefixes, and parent folder names. All readable files
    are retained, including photographs without usable location metadata.
    A separate workflow writes capture dates onto JPEG copies, applies image
    orientation, and optionally reduces their dimensions with Lanczos resampling.
    Original input files are retained, output names avoid collisions, and CSV
    logs record the processing decisions and failures.
